---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import documents from '../../data/documents.json';
import DocLinks from '../../components/DocLinks.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Ffurflen Flynyddol" title_en="Annual Return">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Ffurflen Flynyddol</span><span lang="en">Annual Return</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/the-council/"><span lang="cy">Y Cyngor</span><span lang="en">The Council</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Ffurflen Flynyddol</span><span lang="en">Annual Return</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Ffurflen Flynyddol a Hysbysiadau Archwilio</span><span lang="en">Annual Return and Audit Notices</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan yn llunio Ffurflen Flynyddol bob blwyddyn, sy'n cynnwys y cyfrifon a'r datganiad llywodraethu. Caiff ei harchwilio gan Archwilio Cymru ar ran Archwilydd Cyffredinol Cymru, ac yna ei chyhoeddi ar y dudalen hon.</p>
    <p lang="en">Llansannan Community Council prepares an Annual Return each year, containing the accounts and the governance statement. It is audited by Audit Wales on behalf of the Auditor General for Wales, and then published on this page.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Hawl i Archwilio</span><span lang="en">Right to Inspect</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Mae gan etholwyr lleol hawliau dan Ddeddf Archwilio Cyhoeddus (Cymru) 2004 i archwilio cyfrifon y cyngor a gofyn cwestiynau i'r archwilydd. Mae'r cyngor yn cyhoeddi hysbysiad ar y wefan hon ac yn lleol sy'n nodi pryd a sut y gallwch archwilio'r cyfrifon. Cysylltwch â'r Clerc os oes angen cymorth arnoch.</p>
    <p lang="en">Local electors have rights under the Public Audit (Wales) Act 2004 to inspect the council's accounts and to ask the auditor questions. The council publishes a notice on this website and locally setting out when and how you can inspect the accounts. Contact the Clerk if you need help.</p>

    <div class="minutes-list">
      <div class="minutes-item">
        <div>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Ffurflen Flynyddol 2025/26</span><span lang="en">Annual Return 2025/26</span></strong>
          <div class="fg-meta"><span lang="cy">Yn cynnwys: y cyfrifon a'r datganiad llywodraethu</span><span lang="en">Includes: the accounts and the governance statement</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-links">
          <span style="font-style:italic;font-size:0.9rem" lang="cy">Ar gael wedi archwiliad</span>
          <span style="font-style:italic;font-size:0.9rem" lang="en">Available after audit</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="minutes-item">
        <div>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Ffurflen Flynyddol 2024/25</span><span lang="en">Annual Return 2024/25</span></strong>
          <div class="fg-meta"><span lang="cy">Wedi'i archwilio</span><span lang="en">Audited</span></div>
        </div>
        <DocLinks doc={documents.annual_return} />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="upload-note" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <p lang="cy">Am fwy o wybodaeth am y broses archwilio, cysylltwch â'r Clerc.</p>
      <p lang="en">For more information about the audit process, please contact the Clerk.</p>
    </div>
    <p>
      <a href="/the-council/clerk/"><span lang="cy">Cysylltu â'r Clerc →</span><span lang="en">Contact the Clerk →</span></a>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;
      <a href="https://www.audit.wales/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span lang="cy">Archwilio Cymru →</span><span lang="en">Audit Wales →</span></a>
    </p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
